	<key>Wakely keeps your Mac awake with the lid closed only while it's connected to power. On battery it won't arm, and if you unplug while it's armed, Wakely turns off so your Mac sleeps normally. Plugging back in doesn't turn it on again, though Always On at Home and the trigger components can.</key>
